   "text": "model quality is commoditising:\ncapability becomes cheap and common\nso a wrapper is not a moat",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "b3",
   "originalText": "model quality is commoditising:\ncapability becomes cheap and common\nso a wrapper is not a moat",
